ern sie. Da entdeckt sie in ihren Träumen den Weg in ein magisches Reich: Schlummerland. Dort begegnet sie Flip (Jason Momoa), einer gehörnten Mischung aus Mensch und Monster. Flip behauptet, dass er Peter aus seinen Tagen als Räuber kennt – damals segelte das Duo von Traum zu Traum und stahl Dinge aus den Träumen anderer Menschen. Ist Peter deshalb verschwunden? Nemo und Flip machen sich auf die Suche nach Peter und erleben dabei jede Menge Abenteuer in Schlummerland.","poster":"/3xrcEs9D93EsNWEG1UejBRyV8YB.jpg","runtime":117.0,"title":"Schlummerland","type":"movie","va":7.2,"vc":999,"year":"2022"},"movie:681433":{"cast":[{"id":2313981,"name":"Trishna Mukherjee","photo":"/v8VOaCxectDiRQSY1kh1jrPeGIL.jpg"},{"id":1223428,"name":"Venkat Rahul","photo":"/zUokVDAhGwAKfqvw9TcdQDgXDBB.jpg"},{"id":1060294,"name":"Anish Kuruvilla","photo":"/egs7BnJeBw7txSjoETg2XoqHO8e.jpg"},{"id":566793,"name":"Bikramjeet Kanwarpal","photo":"/efNYmkiCKy2uJHiKapxnDfPWej4.jpg"}],"genres":["Mystery","Thriller"],"id":681433,"original":"మధ","overview":"","poster":"/wZeCuUnDGAsE6jRlvW6XTNP32yT.jpg","runtime":105.0,"title":"మధ","type":"movie","va":3.5,"vc":8,"year":"2020"},"movie:681631":{"cast":[{"id":117175,"name":"Heath C. Heine","photo":"/78v2dtAjbbe9TFNCLR7LmQbeXvV.jpg"},{"id":2564178,"name":"Rick Haak","photo":""},{"id":2564179,"name":"Jon Cotton","photo":""},{"id":2259159,"name":"Dmitri Raskes","photo":"/4j8wNIrV8e7jKPHB4llrfshTCKg.jpg"},{"id":2564180,"name":"Elvis Sharp","photo":""},{"id":1739756,"name":"Ivan Pavletić","photo":"/8hqAwU0GB71u5cTByZtZ7sjpOyN.jpg"},{"id":2564181,"name":"Aga Kistler","photo":""},{"id":2564182,"name":"Rich Richardson III","photo":""}],"genres":["Action","Science Fiction","Horror"],"id":681631,"original":"Jurassic Thunder","overview":"","poster":"/4eJ248ezFwmvcHhdUrD5LNOQzFz.jpg","runtime":84.0,"title":"Jurassic Thunder","type":"movie","va":4.1,"vc":11,"year":"2019"},"movie:686245":{"cast":[{"id":62747,"name":"Chad Michael Murray","photo":"/jIkzUQUVLkgn3HFMFRJBD